    "background_story": "Jude was an avid hiker and explorer, known for his love of venturing off the beaten path. He spent most of his free time trailing through the wilderness, discovering hidden waterfalls and secret meadows. His friends would often joke that he had a sixth sense for finding the most obscure and breathtaking trails. One day, while trailing through the mountains, Jude stumbled upon an old, abandoned mine shaft. His curiosity piqued, he carefully made his way inside, uncovering a hidden world of glittering crystals and ancient fossils. From that day on, Jude became obsessed with uncovering the secrets of the wilderness, always trailing just a step behind the unknown, and always discovering something new and incredible.",
